" Example per-directory config: .vimrc sources a .vim.custom from the directory
" Vim starts in (the name is in .gitignore, so these stay local).
"
" To work inside a directory that is normally gitignored, such as a .venv, put a
" .vim.custom there that makes :FdFiles, :Grep and :RgRaw include ignored files from
" the start (the same switch :FzfToggleIgnored flips):
"
"   let g:fzf_utils_include_ignored = 1
